  "description": {
   "text": "affordable and innovative medicines. Our reportable operating segments are as follows: Pharmaceutical Services and Active Ingredients (“PSAI”); and Others. Global Generics. This segment consists of our business of manufacturing and marketing prescription and over-the-counter finished pharmaceutical products ready for consumption by the patient, marketed under a brand name (branded formulations) or as generic finished dosages with therapeutic equivalence to branded formulations (generics). This segment includes the operations of our biologics business, and the portfolio outside of the United States of consumer brands in the Nicotine Replacement Therapy acquired from Haleon UK Enterprises Limited (the “NRT Business”).",
   "source": "20-F Item 4.B Business Overview",
